1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,710
My dad's truck hasn't moved in two years.

2
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:05,820
But the GPS says it drives every night.

3
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:09,800
Two forty-seven a.m. Thirty-eight miles.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:10,730
Same route.

5
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:13,260
Mom said the tracker was broken.

6
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,630
So I drove the route myself.

7
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:17,230
Highway 9.

8
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:18,630
The old diner.

9
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:19,730
The bridge.

10
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:21,880
And it ended...

11
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,430
in my driveway.

12
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:25,284
Four minutes.

13
00:00:25,284 --> 00:00:26,730
Engine running.

14
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:28,600
Every single night.

15
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:31,320
Last night, it didn't come to my house.

16
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,723
It went to the hospital...

17
00:00:33,723 --> 00:00:36,150
where my son was born that morning.

18
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:38,790
The nurse asked me just one thing.

19
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:42,676
"Who was the old man
in the green jacket...

20
00:00:42,676 --> 00:00:43,670
holding him?"
